        "orijinal_metin": "The primer coatings shall withstand immersion for 24 hours in synthetic lubricating oil conforming to MIL-PRF-23699, and synthetic hydraulic fluid conforming to MIL-PRF-83282. Four hours after removal from the respective fluid, the coatings shall not exhibit any softening, blistering, loss of adhesion, nor any other coating deficiency. Discoloration of the coatings is acceptable and shall not be cause for rejection (see 4.5.10)."
